{% spaceless %}
{% comment %}

Template file for rendering urls.py entries for each OpenAPI endpoint.
Specify how the endpoints parsed from the OpenAPI document should be added to Django's urls.py file.

Context Variables:
- tags: a list of tags parsed from the OpenAPI file

Sorry about the weird spacing throughout, it seems to be the only way it can render properly!

{% endcomment %}

{% comment %} Include imports if not writing to an existing urls.py file. {% endcomment %}
{% if not urls_exists %}
from django.contrib import admin
from django.urls import path

urlpatterns = []
{% endif %}
{% endspaceless %}

# # # OpenAPI to Django Endpoints # # #

openapi_endpoints = [{% for path in paths %}
    path('{{ path.url }}', {{ path.view }}),{% endfor %}
]

urlpatterns.append(openapi_endpoints)
